Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES.CS_EXT_LIST_PRICE,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_LAST_DOM 
FROM 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES.CS_SHIP_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DOW = 6 AND 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_QUARTER_SEQ >= 386


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.CS_EXT_LIST_PRICE AS "CS_EXT_LIST_PRICE",
  Q2.D_LAST_DOM AS "D_LAST_DOM" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.CATALOG_SALES AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.CS_SHIP_DATE_SK) AND 
  (386 <= Q2.D_QUARTER_SEQ) AND 
  (Q2.D_DOW = 6)

Explain level:    Explain from section

